      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, flex: 1 }}>否则：未忽略鉴权且 UserSessionHandler 存在 → 用它检查登录状态；通过则执行第 4 步，否则失败</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, background: '#111C2E', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace', width: 34 }}>4</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, flex: 1 }}>未忽略权限且 PrivilegeHandler 存在 → 用它检查权限</Text>
